          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP309 Shaw's Point&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I approached this one by car this morning the insistent &quot;No Trespassing&quot; signs scared me away from proceeding further south to the point.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
